            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">This unit can use this ability even if it is **in the shadows**. If there is no enemy **mark**, pick an enemy **^^Hero^^** on the battlefield to be the target. If there are no enemy **^^Heroes^^** on the battlefield, pick an enemy non-**^^Hero^^** unit on the battlefield to be the target instead.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">The target is the **mark** for the rest of the battle.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
