          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: You declared a **^^Fight^^** ability for this unit</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a friendly **Black Ark Corsairs** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit&apos;s combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. If it is picked to do so, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target&apos;s melee weapons for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
