            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">This unit&apos;s **Relic Envoy** is a token. Pick a visible friendly **^^Sigmarite^^** unit wholly within 18&quot; of this unit and not **under orders** to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Place this unit&apos;s **Relic Envoy** next to the target. While this unit is **under orders** and on the battlefield and this unit&apos;s **Relic Envoy** is next to the target, the target is **under orders**.</characteristic>
