            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">For the rest of the battle, subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target friendly **^^Infantry^^** or **^^Cavalry^^** units while they are wholly within 3&quot; of the target.</characteristic>
