            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Make an arcane manipulation roll of D6. On a 3+, for the rest of the turn, when picking a target for the &apos;Deathly Candlelight&apos; ability, you can pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit instead of within 12&quot;.</characteristic>
