        <categoryLink name="WIZARD (1)" id="0bc4-c8de-816d-59e4" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="d700-a59a-4293-6eab" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <entryLinks>
        <entryLink name="General" id="4ad9-1250-f86e-59ff" hidden="false" import="true" targetId="a56b-952e-ad15-7868" type="selectionEntry"/>
      </entryLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Erasmus Zonn, the Enlightened One" id="ffd4-1ef1-493c-46e4" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">12&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">9</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Lantern of All-Knowledge" id="9d71-50e8-f139-29c7" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit is wholly within 9&quot; of a corner of the battlefield, pick 1 of the following effects to apply until the start of your next turn:
***Searing Brilliance*:** Friendly **^^Sigmarite^^** units are not visible to enemy units more than 6&quot; from them while those friendly units are wholly within 6&quot; of and visible to this unit.
***Lambent Aura*:** Add 1 to this unit&apos;s power level.
***Luminous Authority*:** Add 2 to arcane manipulation rolls for this unit.
***Prismatic Diffusion*:** Add 3 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit&apos;s **Rod of Radiance** and set its Damage characteristic to 3.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Realmsphere Mastery" id="c1b4-a293-388c-ac8e" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy **^^Manifestation^^** within 12&quot; of this unit and that was not set up this turn to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Make an arcane manipulation roll of 2D6. If the roll equals or exceeds the target&apos;s banishment value, set up an **^^Endless Spell^^** that can be summoned using a **^^Summon^^** spell that this unit can cast within 1&quot; of the target and more than 3&quot; from all enemy units and other enemy **^^Manifestations^^**. If that **^^Endless Spell^^** has multiple parts, both parts must be set up within 1&quot; of the target. This unit has summoned that **^^Endless Spell^^**. If there is already a friendly **^^Endless Spell^^** of the same type on the battlefield, it is immediately banished and removed from play before being set up as described above. Then, the target is banished and removed from play.&apos;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="The Four Corners of the Realms" id="a5c0-28d2-cb52-6395" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)">
          <attributes>
